==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~12.67 seconds<sup>200f~380f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any anti-Red units will help greatly. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] will singlehandedly take care of most of the Reds, but the Shy Boy may be a challenge if unprepared. Build up a solid [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] Stack before St. Pigge the 2nd appears and swiftly kill her along with Shy Boy.

